+    /* dllmgr #78: a window that is not topmost, put after a topmost window
+     * (Photoshop turns its palette's HWND_TOP into "after my hidden topmost
+     * tooltip" in WM_WINDOWPOSCHANGING; swp_owner_popups can also pick a
+     * topmost neighbour), stays non-topmost and goes on top of the
+     * non-topmost windows, as on Windows (tests/wine/zorder78b.c). The
